{'symbol': 'DD', 'date': '2022-04-22 09:01:00', 'title': "DUPONT JOINS APPLE'S SUPPLIER CLEAN ENERGY PROGRAM", 'text': "WILMINGTON, DEL. , APRIL 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DUPONT (NYSE: DD) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS JOINED APPLE'S SUPPLIER CLEAN ENERGY PROGRAM."}{'symbol': 'DD', 'date': '2022-04-22 09:00:00', 'title': 'DUPONT™ KEVLAR®, NOMEX® AND TYVEK® TO RUN ON RENEWABLE ENERGY', 'text': "ALL BRANDED PRODUCTS WILL BE PRODUCED WITH ELECTRICITY BACKED BY RENEWABLE ENERGY CREDITS; KEY MILESTONE IN ACHIEVING COMPANY'S 2030 CLIMATE GOAL WILMINGTON, DEL. , APRIL 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DUPONT (NYSE: DD) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS ICONIC AND TRUSTED BRANDS – KEVLAR®, NOMEX® AND TYVEK® – WILL BE PRODUCED USING RENEWABLE ELECTRICITY IN ITS OPERATIONS."}